	(text "NRST: 100 nF at the pin (DS11929 Fig. 24); the STDC14 probe drives it too.\nBOOT0 (PH3): 10k pull-down, no button (D-035): TP302 to +3V3 at reset, or the boot option bytes over SWD.\nR301 33 Ohm at PB3: source termination of the SCK shared by the DRV8711 and the flash (s9)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
